OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBlustery
OL,6,Fshowers continuing through the
OL,7,Fevening, which may be heavy and
OL,8,Fwintry. Wind and showers generally
OL,9,Feasing overnight before rain spreads
OL,10,Feast into Orkney towards the end of
OL,11,Fthe night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA cloudy day with showers or
OL,14,Fat times longer spells of rain over
OL,15,FOrkney at first which will spread to
OL,16,FShetland later. Winds becoming strong
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
