OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,6,Fand cloudy with showers or longer
OL,7,Fspells of rain on Saturday. Drier on
OL,8,FSunday and Monday but still a few
OL,9,Fshowers possible, and these may be
OL,10,Fwintry.
